        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["h, h, h, h", "Subsection", ExpressionUUID ->
             "3804ea50-63d0-49a7-ae0d-b80011a016ac"], Cell["sm63Particles = {\"h\", \"h\", \"h\", \
\"h\"};\nsm63Amplitude = ConstructAmplitude[sm63Particles, sm, sm, \"FeynmanModel\" -> smFeynman]",
            "Input", ExpressionUUID -> "2472956a-ffbc-42d5-8b7b-d60892492a1b"]}, Open]],
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["C++ export and independent validation", "Subsection",
            ExpressionUUID -> "ad38d4f7-6a0d-473e-a9ee-c726a2836f92"], Cell["Run this cell after all \
helicity amplitudes above have completed successfully. One C++ class contains the complete helicity \
family. The saved Export variable keeps the build and both independent comparisons, including their \
random seeds. The final output is the generated directory on success; a failure remains visible.",
            "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "96b1bdc4-9907-423a-abe6-15c8c22b9de9"],
           Cell["sm63Export = WriteSPINASProcess[\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \
\"sm63_hhhh\"}],\n  {\"h\", \"h\"} -> {\"h\", \"h\"},\n  {\n  {{\"h\", \"h\", \"h\", \"h\"}, \
sm63Amplitude}\n  }, sm,\n  \"ProcessName\" -> \"sm63_hhhh\", Sequence @@ \
validationOptions];\nIf[AssociationQ[sm63Export], sm63Export[\"Directory\"], sm63Export]", "Input",
            ExpressionUUID -> "050ca830-5fcc-47e4-9772-4a407524f263"], Cell["At some phase-space points, \
the Higgs contact and exchange terms nearly cancel. On a saved point where the CalcHEP comparison \
exceeded its 10^-7 tolerance, replaying the same generated evaluator and inputs at 113-bit precision \
reduced the relative difference from 1.74 x 10^-7 to 1.34 x 10^-11. An independent symbolic comparison \
gave zero difference. The size of the numerical residual can vary across platforms and builds.", "Text",
            CellTags -> "hepcat-hhhh-extended-precision-replay", ExpressionUUID ->
             "fac7c0bb-6812-4d5c-9d8e-396c3d9de410"]}, Open]]}, Open]],
